>
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-sys=
tem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(33,33,33)"=
>
I was not provided the names or badge numbers of the state police officers =
at the time of contact. When I asked the USFS special agent's supervisor (C=
aptain Brandon Boyd) to identify the two state officers, he instructed me t=
o file this FOIA request to obtain
 that information.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-sys=
tem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(33,33,33)"=
>
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-sys=
tem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(33,33,33)"=
>
The public has a significant interest in understanding:</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-sys=
tem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(33,33,33)"=
>
- Under what authority state police officers accessed restricted federal la=
nd</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-sys=
tem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(33,33,33)"=
>
- What coordination occurred between state and federal agencies</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-sys=
tem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(33,33,33)"=
>
- Whether this contact was connected to my prior documentation of instituti=
onal conduct at Oregon State Parks</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-sys=
tem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(33,33,33)"=
>
- Whether proper protocols were followed for multi-agency law enforcement c=
ontact with a civilian on federal property</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-sys=
tem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(33,33,33)"=
>
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-sys=
tem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(33,33,33)"=
>
2. I Am Not Seeking Commercial Gain</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-sys=
tem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(33,33,33)"=
>
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-sys=
tem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(33,33,33)"=
>
I am seeking this information solely to understand the circumstances of law=
 enforcement contact at my residence and to exercise my right to know the i=
dentities of officers who appeared at my door. I have no commercial interes=
t in this record.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-sys=
tem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(33,33,33)"=
>
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-sys=
tem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(33,33,33)"=
>
3. Ability to Pay</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-sys=
tem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(33,33,33)"=
>
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-sys=
tem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(33,33,33)"=
>
I am a volunteer caretaker living in an RV with no regular income. The $12.=
50 fee, while modest, represents a meaningful expense given my current fina=
ncial constraints. More importantly, charging a fee to learn the identity o=
f officers who visited my home creates
 a barrier to a fundamental right.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-sys=
tem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(33,33,33)"=
>
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-sys=
tem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(33,33,33)"=
>
4. I Have Every Right to Know Who Visited Me</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-sys=
tem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(33,33,33)"=
>
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-sys=
tem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(33,33,33)"=
>
When law enforcement officers appear at a person's residence=97particularly=
 on restricted federal land where public access is prohibited=97that person=
 has a basic right to know who those officers are. Requiring payment to obt=
ain this information creates an unjust
 barrier to accountability.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-sys=
tem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(33,33,33)"=
>
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-sys=
tem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(33,33,33)"=
>
The CAD record you have identified contains information I should have been =
provided at the time of contact. I should not be required to pay for inform=
ation that should have been disclosed voluntarily.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-sys=
tem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(33,33,33)"=
>
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-sys=
tem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(33,33,33)"=
>
Conclusion</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-sys=
tem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(33,33,33)"=
>
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-sys=
tem,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(33,33,33)"=
>
